Column name: geo Type: STRUCT<continent STRING, sub_continent STRING, country STRING, region STRING, city STRING, metro STRING> Description: The pseudonymous id (e.g., app instance ID) for the user.
Column name: app_info Type: STRUCT<id STRING, version STRING, install_store STRING, firebase_app_id STRING, install_source STRING> Description: The privacy_info fields contain information based on the consent status of a user when consent mode is enabled.
